<p style="margin-top:12pt;padding-top:7pt;border-top:1pt solid #d2d4db;font-size:9pt;color:#5d6068">Every value here is the one implemented in the wireframes and defined once in the stylesheet. Changing a rule means changing the token, not the screens. Open items: a formal contrast audit of the dark theme, and confirmation of the tenant time-zone rule.</p>

</body></html>
